{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43549","headline":"红楼下联句 · 李益","name":"红楼下联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛刹接重城，红楼切太清。\n紫云连照耀，丹槛郁峥嵘。\n榱栋烟虹入，轩窗日月平。\n参差五陵晚，分背八川明。\n松韵风初过，莲陂浪欲倾。\n敬瞻疑涌见，围绕学无生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}